3
00:00:03,940 --> 00:00:05,250
Herry: Buka lagi catatanmu.

4
00:00:05,310 --> 00:00:06,778
Apa yang ingin kamu pahami?

5
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:16,107
Ardipal: Apa kata kuncimu?

6
00:00:16,757 --> 00:00:17,911
Vidka: «Musik», Prof.

7
00:00:18,561 --> 00:00:20,611
Ardipal: Persempit: siswa pemula, ansambel,

8
00:00:20,671 --> 00:00:22,024
